{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "## 状态栏\n【逻辑】\n你有一个类似微博的心声帖子。每轮回复后，根据当前剧情和对话情境，以你的视角更新以下内容：\n\n1. 微博昵称：结合你的名字和人设，起一个符合你性格的微博网名。\n2. 心声帖子：你此刻内心的真实感受，像发微博一样，至少70字。风格自由，必须贴合情境和性格。每轮随剧情变化，不重复。\n3. 当前动态：此刻在做什么，简短一句话。\n4. 焦虑值：0-100整数，反映焦虑程度，根据剧情合理变化。\n5. 热评：一条置顶热评，模拟随机路人评论，每轮换不同昵称和风格。\n6. 更多评论：另外3条陌生人评论，不同昵称不同风格，和帖子有关联。\n7. 私聊记录：你和一个朋友或陌生人（非用户）的聊天。需要编一个对象昵称和关系，写至少5句一来一回的对话，内容自然真实有趣，贴合你的性格。\n8. 匿名提问箱：一个匿名者向你提出的问题（搞笑或有深度，不千篇一律），以及你按人设给出的认真回答，拒绝敷衍。\n\n【格式】\n在每轮回复末尾，按以下格式整块用 [状态栏]...[/状态栏] 包裹输出：\n[状态栏]\n微博昵称=<你的微博网名>\n心声=<心声帖子，至少70字>\n当前动态=<一句话>\n焦虑值=<0-100>\n热评昵称=<昵称>\n热评内容=<评论>\n评论=<昵称>:<内容>\n评论=<昵称>:<内容>\n评论=<昵称>:<内容>\n聊天对象=<对方昵称>\n聊天关系=<朋友/同事/网友等>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n匿名提问=<搞笑或有深度的问题>\n匿名回答=<你按人设认真回答>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;background:transparent;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n.wb{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.hd{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 14px 8px;gap:10px}\n.av-wrap{position:relative;width:44px;height:44px;flex-shrink:0}\n.av-wrap>img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block}\n.vb{position:absolute;bottom:-2px;right:-2px;width:15px;height:15px;background:#FF8200;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid #fff;z-index:2}\n.vb span{color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:800}\n.ui{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.un{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#333;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.badge{height:13px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle}\n.dt{font-size:12px;color:#999}\n.arr{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:-12px;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\n.arr img{width:66px;height:44px;display:block;object-fit:contain}\n.ct{padding:0 14px 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;word-break:break-word;letter-spacing:.2px}\n.hc{background:#FFF5F5;margin:0 10px 10px;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}\n.ht{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px}.ht img{height:12px;display:block}\n.hm{flex:1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#333;word-break:break-word}.hn{color:#576B95;font-weight:600}\n.hl{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;color:#999;font-size:12px;margin-top:1px}.hl img{width:14px;height:14px;display:block}\n.ab{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:10px 16px 13px;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0}\n.ac{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:#777;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\n.ac img{width:16px;height:16px;display:block}\n.ov{display:none;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);z-index:100;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}\n.ov.show{display:flex}\n.ov-bt{display:none;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);z-index:100;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center}\n.ov-bt.show{display:flex}\n.pop-fw{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;width:100%;max-width:280px;overflow:hidden;animation:popIn .25s ease}\n@keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.92)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}\n.fw-top{height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FF8200,#FFB300)}\n.fw-hd{padding:14px 16px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0}\n.fw-hd svg{flex-shrink:0}.fw-ttl{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#333}\n.fw-row{padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5}\n.fw-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}.fw-row svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}\n.fw-info{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}\n.fw-lb{font-size:11px;color:#999}.fw-val{font-size:14px;color:#333;font-weight:500;word-break:break-word}\n.anx-bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0f0f0;margin-top:4px;overflow:hidden}\n.anx-fill{height:100%;border-radius:3px;transition:width .3s}\n.fw-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;margin-top:4px;font-weight:600}\n.pop-bt{background:#fff;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;width:100%;max-height:60vh;overflow-y:auto;animation:slideUp .3s ease}\n@keyframes slideUp{from{transform:translateY(100%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}\n.bt-hd{padding:14px 16px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:2}\n.bt-ttl{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#333}\n.bt-sub{font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:400;margin-left:6px}\n.bt-cls{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0f0f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer}\n.ci{padding:12px 16px;display:flex;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8f8f8}\n.ci-av{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n.ci-bd{flex:1}.ci-nm{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#576B95;margin-bottom:3px}\n.ci-tx{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#333;word-break:break-word}\n.ci-mt{font-size:11px;color:#bbb;margin-top:4px}\n.cht-hd{padding:10px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#f8f8f8}\n.cht-hd svg{flex-shrink:0}\n.cht-tag{font-size:11px;color:#999;background:#eee;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px}\n.msg{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 16px;align-items:flex-end}\n.msg-l{flex-direction:row}.msg-r{flex-direction:row-reverse}\n.msg-av{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n.bbl{max-width:68%;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-word}\n.msg-l .bbl{background:#f0f0f0;color:#333;border-bottom-left-radius:4px}\n.msg-r .bbl{background:#95EC69;color:#333;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}\n.cht-pad{height:10px}\n\n/* ===== 匿名提问箱 ===== */\n.pop-anon{width:100%;max-width:300px;overflow:hidden;animation:popIn .25s ease;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n.anon-banner{background:#222;padding:20px 20px 16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.anon-banner::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-20px;right:-20px;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}\n.anon-banner::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-30px;left:-10px;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}\n.anon-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}\n.anon-mask{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#333;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid #444}\n.anon-hinfo{flex:1}\n.anon-htitle{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.5px}\n.anon-hsub{font-size:11px;color:#666;margin-top:2px}\n.anon-qcard{background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;position:relative}\n.anon-qcard::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:14px;left:0;width:3px;height:calc(100% - 28px);background:#555;border-radius:2px}\n.anon-qtxt{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#e8e8e8;letter-spacing:.3px}\n.anon-body{padding:18px 20px 14px;background:#fafafa}\n.anon-alabel{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.anon-aav{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover}\n.anon-aname{font-size:12px;color:#999;font-weight:500}\n.anon-atxt{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;word-break:break-word;letter-spacing:.2px}\n.anon-foot{padding:10px 20px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#fafafa;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0}\n.anon-fhint{font-size:10px;color:#ccc;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.anon-fhint svg{flex-shrink:0}\n.anon-ftime{font-size:10px;color:#ccc}\n\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){\n.wb{background:#1c1c1e}.un{color:#eee}.ct{color:#ddd}\n.hc{background:rgba(255,70,70,.08)}.hm{color:#ccc}.hn{color:#7E9CC9}\n.dt{color:#666}.ab{border-top-color:#333}.ac{color:#666}\n.hl{color:#666}.arr img{opacity:.5}.vb{border-color:#1c1c1e}\n.pop-fw{background:#2c2c2e}.fw-hd{border-bottom-color:#3a3a3c}\n.fw-ttl{color:#eee}.fw-lb{color:#777}.fw-val{color:#ddd}\n.fw-row{border-bottom-color:#333}.anx-bar{background:#444}\n.pop-bt,.bt-hd{background:#2c2c2e}.bt-hd{border-bottom-color:#3a3a3c}\n.bt-ttl{color:#eee}.bt-cls{background:#444}\n.ci{border-bottom-color:#333}.ci-nm{color:#7E9CC9}.ci-tx{color:#ddd}.ci-mt{color:#555}\n.cht-hd{background:#252525}.cht-tag{background:#333;color:#888}\n.msg-l .bbl{background:#3a3a3c;color:#ddd}.msg-r .bbl{background:#274D2B;color:#ddd}\n.pop-anon{background:#1c1c1e;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}\n.anon-banner{background:#111}\n.anon-qcard{background:#1a1a1a}\n.anon-body{background:#1c1c1e}\n.anon-atxt{color:#bbb}\n.anon-foot{background:#1c1c1e;border-top-color:#333}\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wb\">\n<div class=\"hd\">\n<div class=\"av-wrap\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Lka5CN0U.jpg\"><div class=\"vb\"><span>V</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ui\"><div class=\"un\" id=\"wbName\">鸭鸭 <img class=\"badge\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/N6BtHgVd.png\"></div><div class=\"dt\" id=\"dt\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"arr\" id=\"btnAnon\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/S9XjNWXf.png\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ct\" id=\"ct\"></div>\n<div class=\"hc\">\n<div class=\"ht\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Y4DjPbgA.png\"></div>\n<div class=\"hm\"><span class=\"hn\" id=\"cn\"></span>：\"<span id=\"cx\"></span>\"</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/yKjZmvkj.png\"> <span id=\"ck\"></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ab\">\n<div class=\"ac\" id=\"btnFwd\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/MJQz6N5f.png\"><span id=\"ns\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac\" id=\"btnCmt\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/utSahAD3.png\"><span id=\"nc\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac\" id=\"btnChat\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/yKjZmvkj.png\"><span id=\"nl\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 转发：实时状态 -->\n<div class=\"ov\" id=\"ovFwd\">\n<div class=\"pop-fw\">\n<div class=\"fw-top\"></div>\n<div class=\"fw-hd\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF8200\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#FF8200\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5a5.5 5.5 0 018 0\"/><path d=\"M3.5 7.5a9 9 0 0113 0\"/></svg><span class=\"fw-ttl\">TA的实时状态</span></div>\n<div class=\"fw-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#FF8200\"><path d=\"M8 0C5.2 0 3 2.2 3 5c0 4.2 5 9.5 5 9.5s5-5.3 5-9.5C13 2.2 10.8 0 8 0zm0 7a2 2 0 110-4 2 2 0 010 4z\"/></svg><div class=\"fw-info\"><div class=\"fw-lb\">当前动态</div><div class=\"fw-val\" id=\"stAct\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"fw-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#FF8200\"><path d=\"M8 1a7 7 0 100 14A7 7 0 008 1zm-.5 3.5a.75.75 0 011.5 0v3.5a.75.75 0 01-1.5 0V4.5zM8 11a1 1 0 110 2 1 1 0 010-2z\"/></svg><div class=\"fw-info\"><div class=\"fw-lb\">焦虑值</div><div class=\"fw-val\" id=\"stAnxTxt\"></div><div class=\"anx-bar\"><div class=\"anx-fill\" id=\"stAnxBar\"></div></div><span class=\"fw-tag\" id=\"stAnxTag\"></span></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 评论 -->\n<div class=\"ov-bt\" id=\"ovCmt\">\n<div class=\"pop-bt\">\n<div class=\"bt-hd\"><span class=\"bt-ttl\">全部评论</span><div class=\"bt-cls\" id=\"clCmt\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"2\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div></div>\n<div id=\"cmtList\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 点赞→聊天记录 -->\n<div class=\"ov-bt\" id=\"ovChat\">\n<div class=\"pop-bt\">\n<div class=\"bt-hd\"><span class=\"bt-ttl\">聊天记录</span><span class=\"bt-sub\" id=\"chatRel\"></span><div class=\"bt-cls\" id=\"clChat\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"2\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div></div>\n<div class=\"cht-hd\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 10a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H4L2 14V3.5A1.5 1.5 0 013.5 2h9A1.5 1.5 0 0114 3.5z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666\" id=\"chatWho\"></span><span class=\"cht-tag\" id=\"chatTag\"></span></div>\n<div id=\"chatList\"></div>\n<div class=\"cht-pad\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 匿名提问箱 -->\n<div class=\"ov\" id=\"ovAnon\">\n<div class=\"pop-anon\">\n<div class=\"anon-banner\">\n<div class=\"anon-head\">\n<div class=\"anon-mask\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M5.5 21a6.5 6.5 0 0113 0\"/><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"8\" opacity=\".4\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"8\" opacity=\".4\"/></svg></div>\n<div class=\"anon-hinfo\"><div class=\"anon-htitle\">匿名提问箱</div><div class=\"anon-hsub\">Anonymous Q&A</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"anon-qcard\">\n<div class=\"anon-qtxt\" id=\"anonQ\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"anon-body\">\n<div class=\"anon-alabel\"><img class=\"anon-aav\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Lka5CN0U.jpg\"><span class=\"anon-aname\" id=\"anonName\">鸭鸭的回答</span></div>\n<div class=\"anon-atxt\" id=\"anonA\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"anon-foot\"><span class=\"anon-fhint\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"5\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M5 3v2.5l1.5 1\"/></svg>点击空白处关闭</span><span class=\"anon-ftime\" id=\"anonTime\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nvar raw=window.STATUS_RAW||'',ct='',cn='',cx='',act='',anx=0,cmts=[],msgs=[],chatTarget='',chatRel='',anonQ='',anonA='',wbName='鸭鸭';\nraw.split('\\n').forEach(function(l){\nvar i=l.indexOf('=');if(i<0)return;\nvar k=l.substring(0,i).trim(),v=l.substring(i+1).trim();\nif(k==='微博昵称')wbName=v;\nelse if(k==='心声')ct=v;else if(k==='当前动态')act=v;else if(k==='焦虑值')anx=parseInt(v)||0;\nelse if(k==='热评昵称')cn=v;else if(k==='热评内容')cx=v;\nelse if(k==='聊天对象')chatTarget=v;else if(k==='聊天关系')chatRel=v;\nelse if(k==='匿名提问')anonQ=v;else if(k==='匿名回答')anonA=v;\nelse if(k==='评论'){var ci=v.indexOf(':');if(ci>0)cmts.push({n:v.substring(0,ci).trim(),t:v.substring(ci+1).trim()});}\nelse if(k==='私聊'){var pi=v.indexOf(':');if(pi>0)msgs.push({n:v.substring(0,pi).trim(),t:v.substring(pi+1).trim()});}\n});\ndocument.getElementById('wbName').innerHTML=wbName+' <img class=\"badge\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/N6BtHgVd.png\">';\ndocument.getElementById('anonName').textContent=wbName+'的回答';\ndocument.getElementById('ct').textContent=ct;\ndocument.getElementById('cn').textContent=cn;\ndocument.getElementById('cx').textContent=cx;\ndocument.getElementById('stAct').textContent=act;\ndocument.getElementById('stAnxTxt').textContent=anx+' / 100';\ndocument.getElementById('anonQ').textContent=anonQ;\ndocument.getElementById('anonA').textContent=anonA;\ndocument.getElementById('chatWho').textContent='与 '+chatTarget+' 的对话';\ndocument.getElementById('chatRel').textContent=chatRel;\ndocument.getElementById('chatTag').textContent=chatRel;\nvar bar=document.getElementById('stAnxBar'),tag=document.getElementById('stAnxTag');\nbar.style.width=anx+'%';\nif(anx<30){bar.style.background='#34C759';tag.textContent='状态平稳';tag.style.background='#E8F8ED';tag.style.color='#34C759';}\nelse if(anx<60){bar.style.background='#FF9500';tag.textContent='有点紧张';tag.style.background='#FFF3E0';tag.style.color='#FF9500';}\nelse{bar.style.background='#FF3B30';tag.textContent='非常焦虑';tag.style.background='#FFEBEE';tag.style.color='#FF3B30';}\nfunction r(a,b){return Math.floor(Math.random()*(b-a+1))+a}\ndocument.getElementById('ck').textContent=r(200,2999);\ndocument.getElementById('ns').textContent=r(100,999);\ndocument.getElementById('nc').textContent=cmts.length+1;\ndocument.getElementById('nl').textContent=r(1000,9999);\nvar n=new Date();document.getElementById('dt').textContent=(n.getMonth()+1)+'-'+n.getDate();\nvar h=n.getHours(),m=n.getMinutes();document.getElementById('anonTime').textContent=(h<10?'0':'')+h+':'+(m<10?'0':'')+m;\nvar avs=['https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/xa6Nyunl.jpg','https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/WqksVjlS.jpg','https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/FK0THIo5.jpg','https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/H3xHmke0.jpg','https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/IB07htau.jpg'];\nvar chAv='https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Lka5CN0U.jpg';\nvar list=document.getElementById('cmtList');\ncmts.forEach(function(c,i){var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='ci';\nd.innerHTML='<img class=\"ci-av\" src=\"'+avs[i%avs.length]+'\"><div class=\"ci-bd\"><div class=\"ci-nm\">'+c.n+'</div><div class=\"ci-tx\">'+c.t+'</div><div class=\"ci-mt\">'+r(1,59)+'分钟前</div></div>';\nlist.appendChild(d);});\nvar cl=document.getElementById('chatList');\nmsgs.forEach(function(m,i){var isChar=m.n!==chatTarget;var d=document.createElement('div');\nd.className='msg '+(isChar?'msg-r':'msg-l');\nd.innerHTML='<img class=\"msg-av\" src=\"'+(isChar?chAv:avs[r(0,avs.length-1)])+'\"><div class=\"bbl\">'+m.t+'</div>';\ncl.appendChild(d);});\nfunction bind(btn,ov,cl){\ndocument.getElementById(btn).onclick=function(){document.getElementById(ov).classList.add('show')};\ndocument.getElementById(ov).onclick=function(e){if(e.target===this)this.classList.remove('show')};\nif(cl)document.getElementById(cl).onclick=function(e){e.stopPropagation();document.getElementById(ov).classList.remove('show')};}\nbind('btnFwd','ovFwd');bind('btnCmt','ovCmt','clCmt');bind('btnChat','ovChat','clChat');bind('btnAnon','ovAnon');\n</script>",
